DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10279::$$$message_0078_0000_0000$$$::Class ended and it's almost time to leave.[lr]::
10280::$$$message_0078_0000_0001$$$::There's time until work, so I'll ask Issei if there's anything to do.[lr]::
10281::$$$message_0078_0000_0002$$$::Usually there's always something or another that he hasn't gotten around to yet.::
10282::$$$message_0078_0001_0000$$$::"Oh, Shirou!"[rf][lr]::
10283::$$$message_0078_0001_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...[wait canskip=0 time=800]The hell?[font italic=false][lr]::
10284::$$$message_0078_0001_0002$$$::[font italic=true]I can't help but rub my eyes. Has Illya really snuck in? And not even in the range?[font italic=false]::
10285::$$$message_0078_0002_0000$$$::"I-Illya! What are you doing here?"[play storage=bgm105.ogg][lr]::
10286::$$$message_0078_0002_0001$$$::"I came to hang out with my big brother."[lr]::
10287::$$$message_0078_0002_0002$$$::Illya laughs as she clings onto me.[lr]::
10288::$$$message_0078_0002_0003$$$::When I look around, I find everyone's eyes on me like I'm a criminal. I'm being hugged by a small silver-haired girl with scarlet eyes[line len=2]::
10289::$$$message_0078_0003_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
10290::$$$message_0078_0003_0001$$$::No one has realized.[lr]::
10291::$$$message_0078_0003_0002$$$::The underclassmen won't even look at me despite my panic, nor at Illya, standing a little below chest-height before me.::
10292::$$$message_0078_0004_0000$$$::"...What's going on?"[lr]::
10293::$$$message_0078_0004_0001$$$::"It's easy, I'm just diverting the passing students' field of vision. When you occupy their field of vision and show them something else entirely, a contradiction will occur like this[line len=2]"[lr]::
10294::$$$message_0078_0004_0002$$$::Illya turns her face and eyes away and shows me.::
10295::$$$message_0078_0005_0000$$$::"You shift their line of sight away and around. You can do this easily even when dealing with many targets."[lr]::
10296::$$$message_0078_0005_0001$$$::"They can't help but look somewhere else, so nobody notices..."[lr]::
10297::$$$message_0078_0005_0002$$$::I see, it's a magecraft skill. It's just like Illya to do something of the sort.[lr]::
10298::$$$message_0078_0005_0003$$$::There's no problem if she's hanging out at the kyudo club, but she would need the approval of the faculty or admin in the school building[line len=2]::
10299::$$$message_0078_0006_0000$$$::"What is it, Emiya? You're causing a commotion in front of the door[line len=2]"[lr]::
10300::$$$message_0078_0006_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ06d(中) textoff=0 last=イリヤ01f(中)]Issei, the boss of the student council room, makes a sudden appearance.[lr]::
10301::$$$message_0078_0006_0002$$$::And instead of me, he's looking straight at Illya.[lr]::
10302::$$$message_0078_0006_0003$$$::...Is the spell not working?::
10303::$$$message_0078_0007_0000$$$::"...Uhh, hey, Issei..."[lr]::
10304::$$$message_0078_0007_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
10305::$$$message_0078_0007_0002$$$::Just when I thought Illya's magecraft had activated, and Issei was deceived by an illusion[line len=2][lr]::
10306::$$$message_0078_0007_0003$$$::Illya bows gracefully.::
10307::$$$message_0078_0008_0000$$$::"I'm sorry for making a scene.[lr]::
10308::$$$message_0078_0008_0001$$$::I am Illyasviel. Please forgive me for any inconvenience caused by my sudden visit."[lr]::
10309::$$$message_0078_0008_0002$$$::"...My, what a polite greeting. I am Issei Ryudou, and I have the honor of being this school's student council president."::
10310::$$$message_0078_0009_0000$$$::"Yes, I have heard from Shirou.[lr]::
10311::$$$message_0078_0009_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=イリヤ10a(中) pos=r time=300 textoff=0 last=イリヤ06e(中)]Right? Big Brother?"[lr]::
10312::$$$message_0078_0009_0002$$$::In a blink of an eye, she goes from making a polite introduction to reversing her tone straight to the usual, impish Illya.[lr]::
10313::$$$message_0078_0009_0003$$$::And then she even throws her arms around my waist!::
10314::$$$message_0078_0010_0000$$$::The suspicion doubled at once.[lr]::
10315::$$$message_0078_0010_0001$$$::While Illya clings to me, I feel a cold sweat start to form.[lr]::
10316::$$$message_0078_0010_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
10317::$$$message_0078_0010_0003$$$::"Issei, um, it's a long story, see, uh..."[lr]::
10318::$$$message_0078_0010_0004$$$::"That's right, Issei. Shirou is my big brother, okay?"::
10319::$$$message_0078_0011_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ06e(近) textoff=0]Issei's cold stare is in direct contrast to Illya's warmth.[lr]::
10320::$$$message_0078_0011_0001$$$::And I'm caught in the middle, at danger of collapse from the extreme temperatures to either side...::
10321::$$$message_0078_0012_0000$$$::"Big brother, huh, Emiya?"[lr]::
10322::$$$message_0078_0012_0001$$$::"...Yeah, that's..."[lr]::
10323::$$$message_0078_0012_0002$$$::"...Emiya, come here real quick."[cacheimage storage=イリヤ07a(近)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ07a(近) textoff=0][lr]::
10324::$$$message_0078_0012_0003$$$::This time, I'm pulled away from Illya and brought to the corner of the student council room.::
10325::$$$message_0078_0013_0000$$$::"Emiya, this Miss Illyasviel looks a bit too foreign to be your younger sister..."[lr]::
10326::$$$message_0078_0013_0001$$$::"Well, she's actually the daughter of my old man.[lr]::
10327::$$$message_0078_0013_0002$$$::You remember that I'm adopted, right, Issei?"[lr]::
10328::$$$message_0078_0013_0003$$$::"Oh right, sorry."[lr]::
10329::$$$message_0078_0013_0004$$$::He must've thought he'd overstepped into my private life. The Emiya family's relations are definitely more complex than most.::
10330::$$$message_0078_0014_0000$$$::"So she would be your adoptive sister, and therefore you are her big brother."[lr]::
10331::$$$message_0078_0014_0001$$$::"...That's how it is. Unfortunately."[lr]::
10332::$$$message_0078_0014_0002$$$::"No, it makes sense. It is hard to imagine you committing a crime. [cacheimage storage=一成02c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02c(近) textoff=0]Good, good."[lr]::
10333::$$$message_0078_0014_0003$$$::"A crime, huh... Well, I can't deny that it's suspicious for Illya to be around calling me 'big brother.'"::
10334::$$$message_0078_0015_0000$$$::"However, Emiya, be careful.[lr]::
10335::$$$message_0078_0015_0001$$$::I sense something similar to Tohsaka from that sister of yours."[lr]::
10336::$$$message_0078_0015_0002$$$::...He's oddly sharp.[lr]::
10337::$$$message_0078_0015_0003$$$::It isn't that he can sense spirits, it's like he has an eye for observation that he has developed over many years.::
10338::$$$message_0078_0016_0000$$$::"Tohsaka is enough of a headache for you, yet that sister of yours probably preoccupies you as well.[lr]::
10339::$$$message_0078_0016_0001$$$::That's not good, Emiya. If you lose sight of the right path, it is like walking in a dark and foggy night; it is easy to fall in the gaps in your delusions, [cacheimage storage=一成01b腕(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01b腕(近) textoff=0]so maintain the purification of the six roots of perception[line len=2]"[lr]::
10340::$$$message_0078_0016_0002$$$::"He's saying some rude things, Shirou."[lr]::
10341::$$$message_0078_0016_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成03b(近) textoff=0]Illya comes out of nowhere. And in a bad mood too.[lr]::
10342::$$$message_0078_0016_0004$$$::She must be more angry at the fact that she was called the same kind as Tohsaka, rather than me being warned of my slipping path.::
10343::$$$message_0078_0017_0000$$$::"Besides, Issei, you misunderstand.[lr]::
10344::$$$message_0078_0017_0001$$$::Rin isn't special. Girls are all devilish creatures."[lr]::
10345::$$$message_0078_0017_0002$$$::"J-just when I was wondering what you were going to say..."[lr]::
10346::$$$message_0078_0017_0003$$$::"That Kuzuki you respect is also being deceived by an evil witch, you know? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ02b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ02b(中) textoff=0]Muahahahaha."[lr]::
10347::$$$message_0078_0017_0004$$$::The devilish kid even has a relaxed smile on her face.[lr]::
10348::$$$message_0078_0017_0005$$$::I'm afraid to imagine what she'll be like as an adult if she's already putting on the charm at this age[line len=2]::
10349::$$$message_0078_0018_0000$$$::"I was wondering what you would say, but I do not approve of you speaking ill of Ms. Caster like that, [cacheimage storage=一成02a(近)b][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(近)b textoff=0]and there's absolutely no way Souichirou is so easily deceived."[lr]::
10350::$$$message_0078_0018_0001$$$::"Well, regardless, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=イリヤ11c(中) textoff=0]my big brother's body and soul are already mine from head to toe!"[lr]::
10351::$$$message_0078_0018_0002$$$::And with that bold, misleading statement, Illya throws her arms around me without any consideration for the condemnation in Issei's gaze!::
10352::$$$message_0078_0019_0000$$$::"Hey! I-Illya!"[lr]::
10353::$$$message_0078_0019_0001$$$::"Out with it! Are you attracted to devilish girls after all[line len=2]!"[lr]::
10354::$$$message_0078_0019_0002$$$::"Hehehe, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ03b(近)b][wvl][chgfg time=300 pos=rc storage=イリヤ03b(近)b textoff=0]you're already mine! I'm not giving you to Rin or Saber!"[lr]::
10355::$$$message_0078_0019_0003$$$::"Wahhhh, calm down!"::
10356::$$$message_0078_0020_0000$$$::"...Boy, that was funny. Issei is worth teasing. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ04b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ04b(中) time=400]I kinda get Caster and Rin now."::
10357::$$$message_0078_0021_0000$$$::Illya nods in satisfaction.[lr]::
10358::$$$message_0078_0021_0001$$$::...After that, I somehow calmed a panicking Issei over tea, and Illya was allowed to stay.[lr]::
10359::$$$message_0078_0021_0002$$$::Illya's a horribly accurate dive-bomber, blowing Issei away with a problematic or tricky statement every time.::
10360::$$$message_0078_0022_0000$$$::"...He gets a nervous breakdown dealing with Tohsaka, so don't bully him. He has it tough, all right?"[lr]::
10361::$$$message_0078_0022_0001$$$::Illya struts through school with composure, and the others aren't looking at her.[lr]::
10362::$$$message_0078_0022_0002$$$::I want to feel that I'm okay with this, but it really is unnatural.::
10363::$$$message_0078_0023_0000$$$::"I know that, of course.[lr]::
10364::$$$message_0078_0023_0001$$$::I try not to do things I know you're not a fan of."[lr]::
10365::$$$message_0078_0023_0002$$$::"Ugh, this really was one of those times, though... Anyway, Issei got the wrong impression, I'm sure. I need to clear up any misunderstandings later."::
10366::$$$message_0078_0024_0000$$$::"There's no need to do that.[lr]::
10367::$$$message_0078_0024_0001$$$::I didn't tell any lies, and everything I said to Issei is true."[lr]::
10368::$$$message_0078_0024_0002$$$::"True? Well, opinions on Saber and Tohsaka aside, saying that I'm yours is..."[lr]::
10369::$$$message_0078_0024_0003$$$::Even for showing affection towards your sibling, it's going a little too far.::
10370::$$$message_0078_0025_0000$$$::"But, you're my big brother, right?[lr]::
10371::$$$message_0078_0025_0001$$$::Then you've been mine for a long time now.[lr]::
10372::$$$message_0078_0025_0002$$$::Oh... Or, am I the only one who thinks that...?"::
10373::$$$message_0078_0026_0000$$$::"No, that's..."[lr]::
10374::$$$message_0078_0026_0001$$$::...Suddenly, I'm painfully aware of where I've thought wrong.[lr]::
10375::$$$message_0078_0026_0002$$$::Illya means I'm hers in [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] way.[lr]::
10376::$$$message_0078_0026_0003$$$::Even if we're not connected by blood, she really sees me as her brother.::
10377::$$$message_0078_0027_0000$$$::"...Sorry, Illya.[lr]::
10378::$$$message_0078_0027_0001$$$::That's true, I'm your ol[line len=2]"[lr]::
10379::$$$message_0078_0027_0002$$$::"Gotcha! You're so easy!"[lr]::
10380::$$$message_0078_0027_0003$$$::"...Guh...!"[lr]::
10381::$$$message_0078_0027_0004$$$::...She got me again.[lr]::
10382::$$$message_0078_0027_0005$$$::Am I going to continue to be teased by Illya my whole life...?::
10383::$$$message_0078_0028_0000$$$::"Hehe, but it's true that I rely on you.[lr]::
10384::$$$message_0078_0028_0001$$$::Although it's funny seeing your troubled face.[lr]::
10385::$$$message_0078_0028_0002$$$::When I see you so troubled, I naturally feel like I have to save you."::
10386::$$$message_0078_0029_0000$$$::"That's why I feel like you also need me. In that sense, you are mine."[lr]::
10387::$$$message_0078_0029_0001$$$::"...Haah."[lr]::
10388::$$$message_0078_0029_0002$$$::I give up and drop my shoulders.[lr]::
10389::$$$message_0078_0029_0003$$$::...Well... If that's the reason, then being hers is something I can take a bit of pride in...I think?::
10390::$$$message_0078_0030_0000$$$::"Huh? Shirou, where are you going?"[lr]::
10391::$$$message_0078_0030_0001$$$::"The kyudo club. If you come, they'll serve tea for you."[lr]::
10392::$$$message_0078_0030_0002$$$::Fuji-nee introduces Illya to the kyudo club members.[lr]::
10393::$$$message_0078_0030_0003$$$::She's a foreign lady, so there's no doubt they would treat her with great hospitality.::
10394::$$$message_0078_0031_0000$$$::"Oh, Sakura's place. She's the captain of the club, right? She consulted with me the other day.[lr]::
10395::$$$message_0078_0031_0001$$$::Like how to take a leading position or how to act as a leader."::
10396::$$$message_0078_0032_0000$$$::Illya brings up something interesting.[lr]::
10397::$$$message_0078_0032_0001$$$::She's blessed with a feeling of nobility, so Sakura must have wanted to hear what she had to say.::
10398::$$$message_0078_0033_0000$$$::"I appreciate when you help Sakura even more than me."[lr]::
10399::$$$message_0078_0033_0001$$$::"Of course. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ11c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=イリヤ11c(中) time=400 textoff=0]I need to look after my precious younger siblings as a big sister.[lr]::
10400::$$$message_0078_0033_0002$$$::It sure is tough when I also have a grown little sister on top of it all."::
10401::$$$message_0078_0034_0000$$$::Big sister... Illya's habit of acting mature.[lr]::
10402::$$$message_0078_0034_0001$$$::Also, "grown little sister" must be referring to Fuji-nee.::
10403::$$$message_0078_0035_0000$$$::"Oh... Senpai, [cacheimage storage=桜弓道着01b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜弓道着01b(中) pos=r time=400]and Miss Illya, too."[lr]::
10404::$$$message_0078_0035_0001$$$::"Hello, Sakura.[lr]::
10405::$$$message_0078_0035_0002$$$::I came to watch, but can I come in?"[lr]::
10406::$$$message_0078_0035_0003$$$::"Yes, welcome! How about you, Senpai?"::
10407::$$$message_0078_0036_0000$$$::...Well, about that.[lr]::
10408::$$$message_0078_0036_0001$$$::I already fulfilled my objective of bringing Illya here, so I have no real reason to join them.::
10409::$$$message_0078_0037_0000$$$::"Oh... No, please take care of Illya.[lr]::
10410::$$$message_0078_0037_0001$$$::I still have a lot to do."[lr]::
10411::$$$message_0078_0037_0002$$$::"Oh, okay... [cacheimage storage=桜弓道着03h(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜弓道着03h(中) pos=r time=400]I'll see you later then."[lr]::
10412::$$$message_0078_0037_0003$$$::"See you, Big Brother!"::
10413::$$$message_0078_0038_0000$$$::She sees me off with a smile.[lr]::
10414::$$$message_0078_0038_0001$$$::...Now.[lr]::
10415::$$$message_0078_0038_0002$$$::I'm reluctant to leave, but I'll pretend like I'm going to work.::
910351::$$$message_9078_0018_0002$$$::And with that bold, misleading statement, Illya throws her arms around me without any consideration for the condemnation in Issei's gaze![r]::

